{"id":"n24578-1-7","stage":4,"title":"조개 · 贝","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24578-1-7-1","ko":"칼국수가 정말 맛있어요.","zh":"刀切面真好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"칼국수가","meaning":"刀切面","explanation":"칼국수：刀切面；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"칼국수","audio":"/audio/c32ee6456393ca88f0b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28144","senseId":"1","lemma":"칼국수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"칼국수가","audio":"/audio/9b5e814bd4d9bb3769b7.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있어요","audio":"/audio/d2df2197e887a0da537c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c32ee6456393ca88","term":"칼국수","zh":"刀切面","audio":"/audio/c32ee6456393ca88f0b5.mp3","entryId":"28144","definition":"一种面条，先用面粉和面后把面团擀平，然后用刀切成细条；或指将其下锅煮熟做成的食物。","pronunciation":["칼국쑤"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c815cddd610afa62342c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24578-1-7-2","ko":"응. 조개를 많이 넣고 끓였더니 국물 맛이 시원하네.","zh":"嗯，放了很多贝类来煮，汤特别鲜爽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI