맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"시원하네.","meaning":"爽口，清爽","explanation":"시원하다：爽口，清爽；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"2","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하네","audio":"/audio/d7043551ad89bfa298cc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"95690e3b8beb9f76","term":"조개","zh":"贝，蛤蜊","audio":"/audio/95690e3b8beb9f76e6e5.mp3","entryId":"24578","definition":"生长在海水或淡水里，在坚硬、圆润、扁平的双壳里藏着人类可食用的肉的软体动物。","pronunciation":["조개"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放入，加入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使跟别的东西混合或参杂在一起。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"e0e928624bcebfda","term":"끓이다","zh":"煮，烧","audio":"/audio/e0e928624bcebfda14ca.mp3","entryId":"59474","definition":"把食物放进水或液体里加热，制作食品。","pronunciation":["끄리다"]},{"id":"28fc4f685e87f9f4","term":"국물","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/28fc4f685e87f9f4926f.mp3","entryId":"64512","definition":"在清汤或浓汤等食物里，除去汤料以外剩下的水。","pronunciation":["궁물"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"爽口，清爽","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"食物冰凉爽快、正合胃口，或热乎得让人畅快淋漓。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9808c4bf68bfd2028bad.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24578","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，放了很多贝类来煮，汤特别鲜爽。","刀切面真好吃。","一直待在房间里，真让人闷啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["刀切面真好吃。","一直待在房间里，真让人闷啊。","嗯，放了很多贝类来煮，汤特别鲜爽。"],"answer":2}]}
